   "level": 3,
   "heading": "About Center",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "p",
     "text": "Intervention is about helping people who are having a hard time asking for help. When done correctly, it’s extremely effective to help people start dealing with alcohol addiction, cocaine, heroin, or even gambling addiction. Our experienced, empathetic staff are here to help. EDGEWOOD can direct you to a qualified Intervention Specialist.",
