 "raw_html": "<body><div class=\"eltdf-grid eltdf-ls-content-area\">\n<div class=\"rehabIntro\">\n<div class=\"rehabContent\">\n<div class=\"excerptData\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"eltdf-ls-content\">\n<div class=\"eltdf-ls-content-inner\">\n<h3><strong>About</strong> Center</h3>\n<p>Intervention is about helping people who are having a hard time asking for help. When done correctly, it’s extremely effective to help people start dealing with alcohol addiction, cocaine, heroin, or even gambling addiction. Our experienced, empathetic staff are here to help. EDGEWOOD can direct you to a qualified Intervention Specialist.</p>\n<div class=\"specialAmenities\">\n<div class=\"specialties\">\n<h4>Specialties</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"allamenities\">\n<h4>Amenities</h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h4>Therapies</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Holistic Therapy</li>\n<li>Evidence-Based Practices</li>\n<li>Yoga &amp; Meditation</li>\n<li>Individual Therapy &amp; Counseling</li>\n<li>Family Therapy &amp; Counseling</li>\n<li>Group Therapy &amp; Counseling</li>\n<li>Nutritional Counseling</li>\n<li>Art &amp; Nature Therapy</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div> </div>\n<div class=\"rehabContacts\">\n<div class=\"rehabContactsSidebar\">\n<div class=\"eltdf-ls-location\">\n<div class=\"eltdf-ls-location-contact-info\">\n<div class=\"eltdf-ls-location-cid-holder\">\n<p class=\"eltdf-ls-location-phone\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"eltdf-icon-font-elegant icon_mobile\"></span> <a class=\"eltdf-ls-location-phone-link\" data-wpel-link=\"internal\" href=\"tel:(250) 751-0111\" itemprop=\"url\">(250) 751-0111</a>\n</p>\n<p class=\"eltdf-ls-location-email\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"eltdf-icon-font-elegant icon_mail\"></span> <a class=\"eltdf-ls-location-email-link\" href=\"mailto:info@edgewood.ca\" itemprop=\"url\">info@edgewood.ca</a>\n</p>\n<p class=\"eltdf-ls-location-site-url\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"eltdf-icon-font-elegant icon_globe-2\"></span> <a class=\"eltdf-ls-location-site-url-link\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" href=\"http://www.edgewood.ca/index.php?page=23\" itemprop=\"url\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.edgewood.ca/index.php?page=23</a>\n</p>\n<p class=\"eltdf-ls-location-address\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"eltdf-icon-font-elegant icon_house\"></span>\t                    2121 Boxwood Rd, Nanaimo, BC V9S 4L2, Canada\t                </p>\n</div>\n<button class=\"eltdf-btn eltdf-btn-huge eltdf-btn-solid eltdf-btn-icon eltdf-enquiry-opener\" type=\"submit\"> <span class=\"eltdf-btn-text\">Contact Business</span> <i class=\"eltdf-icon-ion-icon icon ion-android-person\"></i> </button>\n<div class=\"eltdf-ls-location-social\">\n<h5 class=\"eltdf-ls-location-social-title\">Social</h5>\n<a class=\"eltdf-ls-location-social-facebook\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pages/Edgewood/119607748068175\" itemprop=\"url\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<i class=\"fab fa-facebook-f\"></i>\n</a>\n<a class=\"eltdf-ls-location-social-twitter\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" href=\"https://twitter.com/EdgewoodHealth\" itemprop=\"url\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<i class=\"fab fa-twitter\"></i>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div> <div class=\"eltdf-ls-ads\">\n<h4 class=\"eltdf-ls-parts-title\">Sponsored Ad</h4>\n<div class=\"eltdf-ls-ads-info\">\n<a class=\"eltdf-ls-ads-link\" data-wpel-link=\"internal\" href=\"tel:1-855-885-4747\" itemprop=\"url\"><img alt=\"addiction rehab centres\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"920\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 970px) 100vw, 970px\" src=\"https://addictionrehabcenters.ca/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/addiction-rehab-centers-canada-1.jpg\" srcset=\"https://addictionrehabcenters.ca/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/addiction-rehab-centers-canada-1.jpg 970w, https://addictionrehabcenters.ca/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/addiction-rehab-centers-canada-1-300x285.jpg 300w, https://addictionrehabcenters.ca/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/addiction-rehab-centers-canada-1-768x728.jpg 768w\" width=\"970\"/></a> <h2 class=\"eltdf-ls-ads-title\">\n<a class=\"eltdf-ls-ads-link\" data-wpel-link=\"internal\" href=\"tel:1-855-885-4747\" itemprop=\"url\">Start Your Journey Now</a> </h2>\n<p class=\"eltdf-ls-ads-text\">Are you or a loved one struggling with alcohol or drug addiction? Finding the right addiction treatment centre can make all the difference in achieving long-term recovery. That's why we've done the research for you and compiled a list of the best alcohol and drug addiction centres in Canada.\nOur list includes top-rated addiction treatment centres that provide evidence-based therapies, personalized treatment plans, and aftercare support services to help clients overcome addiction and maintain a healthy, fulfilling life in recovery. Whether you're looking for residential or outpatient treatment, we've got you covered.\n\nFor immediate treatment help call: 1-855-885-4747</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></body>"
